{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-12_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-12",
  "title": "冰原之霜",
  "storyCode": "6-14",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-12_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cd42a6d8c13c3ac9a67f779c03e9ce5a3185e5264587ad1d331a199432af56c8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "居然......雪怪居然......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "......真慘。真就全死在這龍門了。感染者的希望和傳說又少了一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "快走，近衛局的人要追下來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "......你的眼神有些不大對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "說實話，原本我一直懷疑你是龍門那邊的臥底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那現在呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "反正別人都不信就是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的間諜會殺你滅口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "我其實真不怕你殺我。看看龍門這樣子。哪怕你是龍門人，你也回不去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "因為你會比我們過得還慘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......所以我不是。我現在已經什麼都不是了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "你在幹什麼？咦，開花了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "哦哦，這是你的法術嗎？有點好看啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "九",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總得有人給他們留一點點敬意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "磨磨蹭蹭的......花了那麼長時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我覺得做得很不錯。一天之內就消滅了龍門城內的全部整合運動，我可以給最高分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_040",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "魏彥吾了不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太合，你有沒有聽過那個傳聞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是說魏彥吾的身世？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_040",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "勿論上事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉。不過，那些黑蓑的身手與當今禁軍相比，何如？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，你也太高估他們了。他們的確有過人之處不假......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_040",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們這些混帳！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "——絞合線？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你並不想真的殺我，對嗎？你本來能用法術的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "我聽說用線做武器的男人，無一例外全是心理變態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實總有人這麼說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感染者，別妨害公務。小心我把你一併處理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "沒有身份識別碼的武裝人員在戰場上遭到殺害，這種事根本怨不得人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們同樣可以指證你與這些整合運動有所勾連。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你們還沒有調查我合作夥伴的權限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我們已經知道有一艘屬於“感染者對策專家”的艦船停在龍門泊區，陳警司。這也是這位煌小姐尚未收到傷害的唯一理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那諸位還要看到什麼時候？還要再給龍門人的出生入死打幾次分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說話放尊重點。龍門風險控制能力的評估，本來就是因為重視你們才做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那真抱歉，我換種說法吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我們這場鬧劇，三位看得盡興不？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "監察司",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_039_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "煌，收手吧，這三位貴人不是你我該伺候的，穿雨披的那些也確實不是他們的同行人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，煌小姐。希望我剛剛沒有讓你產生不快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......你挺有禮貌的。但我很討厭你說話的語氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的炎腔味道很正。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的確繼承了你父親不少東西。只不過，現在的你只是個感染者，路很難走，也很短。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_040",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_041",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那麼再會，煌小姐，陳警司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "等一下！你剛才說我爸什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#6",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "煌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不要忘了任務！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳長官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我們沒發現敵人指揮官的蹤跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "哪一位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我們只知道梅菲斯特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "接下來的追擊，就由我們羅德島來完成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不用太冒進。這場戰役實質上已經結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但他犯下的暴行......必須要被償還。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "交給你們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那麼我們就各自出發吧。我還有件必須要去親眼驗證的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "等等，近衛局的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "......剛才謝謝你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "沒別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "呵，彼此彼此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "為什麼一定要挑剛才的時機行動？煌......你不是在這種時候做出錯誤判斷的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "一是我真的很火......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "二是我一早就看出來，近衛局那個姓陳的也會很火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我們也沒法判斷出兩方誰究竟更有話語權。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "所以我就挑我樂意的那個來。"
    },
    {
