        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "我會突然想起，在三四年以前，他想努力唱歌的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他能唱歌？可浮士德說過，他的嗓子......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "他有努力過。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "就像我們感染者，雖然最後都會被礦石病吞噬掉生命......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "卻還是努力想要活下去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "讓他剩下的生命繼續懲罰他吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "告訴我，幻影弩手。羅德島參與了剛才的戰鬥嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你是說......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......沒有。據我所知，沒有。他們沒有和雪怪們戰鬥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......太幼稚了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你真要留下來？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_016",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他們不一定會繼續追擊，霜星。別在這裡耗費生命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "我在廢城認識了幾個人，現在我還想再見他們一面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "畢竟這是我的承諾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "而且，我知道他們一定會來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "霜星......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "走吧，戰友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "這場戰鬥，整合運動輸了，也許，整合運動也做錯了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "但你們還沒有。你們還有得選，還有改正的機會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "走吧。不要回頭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
